Scoped maskfun video filter

The option table, pix_fmts list, low/high binarisation, plane mask and plane
copy, getsum empty-frame test, set_max_sum threshold and fill_frame empty frame
in src/video-ops/maskfun.ts follow libavfilter/vf_maskfun.c (maskfun_options,
pix_fmts, filter_frame, getsum8, maskfun8, fill_frame, set_max_sum,
config_input, process_command).
